The packaged local model pack distributes frozen upstream artifacts for:

- BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5, revision
  5c38ec7c405ec4b44b94cc5a9bb96e735b38267a, declared MIT license.
- cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2, revision
