PaceBack does not fine-tune these models or update them from user data. Exact
source URLs, distributed file hashes and sizes, pack/signature/trust-key hashes,
and license declarations are recorded in engine/MODEL_PROVENANCE.md. Canonical
upstream license texts are checked in under third_party/model_licenses and are
embedded in the macOS application bundle. This summary and those texts are not a
substitute for a final redistribution review.

